// expect: EK0705
// Decided details 214, 240 and 249: an is binding in a formal-parameter or enum
// initializer has no settled home. The destructured-parameter, computed-key and
// catch-parameter forms are covered by is_binding_context_test.go: the
// TypeScript 7 mapper does not render a function with an is in a destructured
// parameter, and the purity corpus compares every case function's rendering.
function f1(a=(1 is let one)){return a}
enum E{A=(1 is let one)?1:0}
